    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3278d9dc88c69866391afca1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想这一定……也是目白家的职责之一。\n毕竟长久以来我们都一直支撑着赛马娘界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89814952d67d3c1c256f6cd1540dcde62672d16c895916dd87177725d1a04b2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fdcaaf9bebde60426c47279",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来想开温泉旅馆的梦想并不仅仅只是余兴。\n她身为目白家赛马娘，\n这也是她的责任之一……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0abd29a8608f54f207955adf86f22a768d2c076a0e5e0230ac9314bbd52f055c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e9ad8d080c32b7dfa2e79cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明散发出的光芒……\n即将照亮整个赛马娘界的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b713dc0bc7469a37dbc7158dcdca728e16222ee1c136446a357ae788ceb96439",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
