    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66061228d1ec114affe9725f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀……\n既然能让训练员大人感到满足，\n那我也觉得有点自信了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a452d4e7061301d9b030db0f57e1c1317e4e77eff93ce0bb509fd62d0d4b5f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
