      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a771266274d6f08e902c91c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她想做的事十分高尚，我想帮助她完成。\n让我陪着目白光明一起\n实现这个温柔又崇高的梦想吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb47d52c44ad4ed2743b45cc6e096b0a0c6d981eef8a2989f8a2e500898e0c35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31cda5bf5618cb839991181f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在这段时光中，\n深刻感受到了\n与目白光明之间无可取代的情谊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4532cf15f6c01208eabf464892fdc4a91c683e1d1ad977dd34213caa3ab5fae5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074112.json",
      "json_path": [
