      "uid": "zhcn:00af3f0cff33fd54e5f1c593",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "获得不让目白家赛马娘身份蒙羞的成绩，\n好让自己有资格休息……\n这个过程了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "648e388ca4d55e5907808f17ebc1ecbc82a88f59d82c83122acc5c66d64f6ea9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
